    <!-- User Guide -->
    <string name="guia_titulo">USER GUIDE</string>
    <string name="guia_sec1_titulo">1. Monthly Overview &amp; Charts</string>
    <string name="guia_sec1_desc">Get a clear financial overview for the selected month using the top selector. The pie chart and list detail your exact spending breakdown by category and percentage.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec2_titulo">2. Savings Goal &amp; Progress</string>
    <string name="guia_sec2_desc">Set your monthly savings target. The progress bar updates automatically with transactions from the \'Savings\' category and syncs across all your devices in real time.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec3_titulo">3. Detailed List &amp; Filters</string>
    <string name="guia_sec3_desc">Access your full transaction history. Search by keyword, filter by type using tabs, and use the dedicated header back button to quickly return to your overview.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec4_titulo">4. Add &amp; Edit Transactions</string>
    <string name="guia_sec4_desc">Tap the \'+\' button on the Transactions screen to register a new entry (Income or Expense) using the quick toggle. The amount field adapts to your currency (€ or $) with automated cents formatting during typing and dynamic category icons.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec5_titulo">5. Smart Recurrence</string>
    <string name="guia_sec5_desc">Enable recurrence for fixed or installment transactions. When editing or deleting a recurring item, choose whether to apply changes only to the selected month or to all future months.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec6_titulo">6. Custom Categories</string>
    <string name="guia_sec6_desc">Create and manage custom categories via \'Manage Categories\' or while logging entries. The category field automatically inherits the icon assigned to each category.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec7_titulo">7. Due Date Notifications</string>
    <string name="guia_sec7_desc">Receive automatic alerts for upcoming bills (due today, within 3 days, or recently overdue). Tapping a notification opens directly into your Overview. Toggle this on or off in your profile.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec8_titulo">8. Export Reports (PDF / CSV)</string>
    <string name="guia_sec8_desc">Export monthly financial reports directly from the side drawer. Choose between high-resolution PDF documents (with charts and tables) or structured CSV spreadsheets (ready for Excel or Google Sheets).</string>
    <string name="guia_sec9_titulo">9. Yearly Overview</string>
    <string name="guia_sec9_desc">Open the side drawer to view your annual bar chart, comparing actual monthly earnings against total expenditures throughout the entire year.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec10_titulo">10. Real-Time Cloud Sync</string>
    <string name="guia_sec10_desc">When you register an account, your transactions, savings goals, and categories sync securely to the cloud with end-to-end encryption across all your mobile devices.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec11_titulo">11. Guest Mode (100% Local)</string>
    <string name="guia_sec11_desc">Explore all app features without an account. In Guest Mode, your data remains stored strictly on your device memory with complete privacy.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec12_titulo">12. Dark &amp; Light Mode</string>
    <string name="guia_sec12_desc">Tailor the visual interface to your style. Switch between Dark and Light mode from your profile settings for a comfortable experience at any time of day.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec13_titulo">13. Security &amp; Privacy</string>
    <string name="guia_sec13_desc">Your privacy is our utmost priority. Finly leverages cutting-edge encryption to ensure that only you can access your personal financial information.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec14_titulo">14. Biometric Lock / Fingerprint</string>
    <string name="guia_sec14_desc">Protect your app against unauthorized access. Turn on biometric unlock in your profile to require fingerprint or PIN authentication whenever Finly opens. Biometric settings sync with your cloud profile.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec15_titulo">15. Financial Insights &amp; Projections</string>
    <string name="guia_sec15_desc">Receive automated budget warnings when spending exceeds 100% of income, review percentage indicators comparing to the previous month, and check end-of-month projected balances based on pending bills.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec16_titulo">16. Period Selector &amp; File Exporting</string>
    <string name="guia_sec16_desc">Tap the month header to trigger a 4x3 month grid (JAN..DEC) with a horizontal year selector. Selection syncs smoothly between Overview and List. Export formatted PDF and CSV reports saved directly to your Downloads folder.</string>
    <string name="guia_sec17_titulo">17. Multi-Currency System &amp; Onboarding</string>
    <string name="guia_sec17_desc">Select your primary currency (€ EUR, $ USD, or R$ BRL) during initial onboarding. All views, charts, inputs, and reports adapt dynamically with fractional digit formatting and sync across devices.</string>
